sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer (React)
  participant O as OrderService
  participant I as Inventory (DB)
  participant P as PaymentService
  participant G as Gateway (Razorpay / Fake)
  participant E as Email (async)

  C->>O: POST /orders {addressId} + Idempotency-Key
  Note over O,I: ONE transaction
  O->>O: same key seen before? → return that order (200)
  O->>I: lock cart · UPDATE stock = stock − qty<br/>WHERE stock ≥ qty (sorted by product id)
  I-->>O: 1 row updated per line (else 409, all rolled back)
  O->>O: snapshot prices + address · status PLACED · clear cart
  O-->>C: 201 order NC-20261106-…
  O--)E: OrderPlaced (after commit) → "complete your payment"

  C->>P: POST /payments/{order}/initiate
  P->>G: create gateway order (amount from DB, in paise)
  P-->>C: providerOrderId, key id, amount
  C->>G: customer pays in the popup
  G-->>C: paymentId + HMAC-SHA256 signature
  C->>P: POST /payments/verify {orderId, paymentId, signature}
  P->>P: recompute HMAC with the SECRET · constant-time compare
  alt signature valid
    P->>O: lock order row · PLACED → CONFIRMED
    P-->>C: 200 CONFIRMED
    P--)E: PaymentReceived → receipt email
  else forged / tampered
    P-->>C: 400 PAYMENT_VERIFICATION_FAILED (order stays PLACED)
  end

  Note over O,I: Unpaid after 30 min → expiry job (SKIP LOCKED)<br/>asks the gateway first, else CANCELLED + stock released
